	(text "V1.1A:\n- 3.3V IC families\nV1.3A:\n- pull color logic into FPGA\nV1.3B:\n- add audio output via MCP4802\nV1.3C\n- stereo jack to get out both channels\nV2.1A:\n- replace SRAM with TSOP-II 44 footprint\n- add 2nd option for audio plug\nV3.0A:\n- go to 16 bit Video RAM (1MB instead of 512k)"
